5
00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:28.407
Enduring influence. Say it with me. Enduring influence!

6
00:00:31.927 --> 00:00:36.561
Transformative. Say it with me. Transformative!

7
00:00:40.063 --> 00:00:44.530
Contribution. Say it with me. Contribution!

8
