Posterity. Say it with me. Posterity!

9
00:00:55.809 --> 00:00:59.642
Visionary. Say it with me. Visionary!

10
00:01:03.141 --> 00:01:08.357
Societal impact. Say it with me. Societal impact!

11
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:16.673
Lasting change. Say it with me. Lasting change!

12
00:01:20.194 --> 00:01:24.077
Stewardship. Say it with me. Stewardship!

13
