15
00:01:42.651 --> 00:01:53.075
Grammar time! Future perfect for legacy. Listen. By the time she retires, she will have made a lasting change.

16
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:59.719
Your turn. Say it with me. By the time she retires, she will have made a lasting change.

17
00:02:04.698 --> 00:02:14.852
A visionary leaves an enduring influence through transformative contribution. True stewardship considers societal impact and lasting change for posterity.

18
