Contribution!

21
00:02:24.891 --> 00:02:30.148
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:30.198 --> 00:02:31.713
Lasting change!

23
00:02:32.948 --> 00:02:41.337
Think and answer. What kind of legacy would you like to leave?

24
